{"5023770": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Let's Tidy Up! : Treasure", "steam_appid": 5023770, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THE TREASURE ROOM IS A MESS. SOMEONE HAS TO SORT IT OUT!</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <br>⛏️ <strong>Organize the Dwarfs Hoard</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It has been a particularly lucrative year in the Dwarf mines. So much so, that the loot has completely swallowed up the treasure room and everything inside it. As B.E.A.R.D's (Bureau of Earnings, Assets, Revenue &amp; Debts) newest intern it is your job to SORT. IT. OUT.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>💰 Sweep up the Stash</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather up armfuls of gold at a time and deposit them into the racks around the hall; when one fills up, you'll earn a skill point to unlock powerful runes that will assist you in this mammoth task.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>📜Find what the gold buried</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you dig through the mountain of gold you will uncover relics of bygone eras and secrets buried beneath. The more you sort, the more you will discover.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THE TREASURE ROOM IS A MESS. SOMEONE HAS TO SORT IT OUT!</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <br>⛏️ <strong>Organize the Dwarfs Hoard</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It has been a particularly lucrative year in the Dwarf mines. So much so, that the loot has completely swallowed up the treasure room and everything inside it. As B.E.A.R.D's (Bureau of Earnings, Assets, Revenue &amp; Debts) newest intern it is your job to SORT. IT. OUT.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>💰 Sweep up the Stash</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather up armfuls of gold at a time and deposit them into the racks around the hall; when one fills up, you'll earn a skill point to unlock powerful runes that will assist you in this mammoth task.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>📜Find what the gold buried</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you dig through the mountain of gold you will uncover relics of bygone eras and secrets buried beneath. The more you sort, the more you will discover.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2>", "short_description": "Let's Tidy Up! : Treasure is a cozy organizing simulator about tidying up a Dwarf treasure room after a particularly lucrative year. Complete full shelves to unlock skills and abilities. Sort, stack and shelve 8,888 unique items as you slowly unravel the secrets beneath...", "supported_languages": "English, Japanese, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5023770/aea9e512443dcf241f8e70a5a9e0448c9839f106/header.jpg?t=1787679241", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5023770/ecf82a9bc1b51e90dc2632d5b8c6bee7bd071da5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787679241", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5023770/ecf82a9bc1b51e90dc2632d5b8c6bee7bd071da5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787679241", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong>  64-bit Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i7-4790k / AMD Ryzen 5 1500X<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 980 Ti 6GB / AMD Radeon RX 6500XT<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> 64-bit Windows 10<br></li><